:"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-05-23T22:45:53Z","updated_at":"2018-05-23T22:47:53Z","body":"Another aspect we discussed, is that tserver should ideally create a union of the heartbeat response list with its current in-memory list. This would avoid cases that could override the config/file value, causing it to miss any masters that are in the conf file. And vice-versa, if union in-memory is superset of what is on disk (if conf file is used), then we should ideally persist it for next restart. \r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/391523148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bbaddepudi","id":6334739,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMzQ3Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6334739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi","html_url":"https://github.com/bbaddepudi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/391523654","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-d